lesson.instructions:
✨ Transitions animate a property change smoothly instead of snapping instantly.
The shorthand is: transition: property duration ease;
Example: transition: background 0.3s ease;
This makes background color changes animate over 0.3 seconds.
👉 Your mission: add a transition on the button background lasting 0.3s.

